From 082977a63ca1d83b7a1596ae5fe55a845a83b1cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Muggli <nmuggli@google.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 18:00:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fix integer overflow and heap OOB write errors

Replaced stack-allocated Variable Length Arrays (VLAs) with dynamic
heap allocations in write_flate to eliminate stack overflow vectors.
Added robust integer overflow checks using unsigned long long when
calculating expanded pixel sizes (header.cupsBytesPerLine * 6) and
reject sizes exceeding INT_MAX early with Z_MEM_ERROR.

Bug: 511640905
Test: Ensure printing still works
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:6a68ec5827c47b489ad6c0d618539a03b6c4a030
Merged-In: I934add5868d832899dfebed68a1eff00f535e62d
Change-Id: I934add5868d832899dfebed68a1eff00f535e62d
---
